From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 10:31:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(desk): indexes, cheaper reads, main-dash link, email
 verification - desk.indexes.fragment.json: add desk_audit(agentId,at desc),
 desk_ledger(agentId,status|kind), desk_sessions(agentId,status) - schedulers
 (reconcileTickets, reconcilePayouts, sweepRequests) 512MiB -> 256MiB -
 sweepRequests: skip the public-config state read when this instance already
 confirmed the hash - desk_top_listDesks: exact COG-#### search is a 1-read
 lookup instead of an up-to-5000-doc scan - Frame: 'Main dashboard' link
 (sidebar + More menu) back to /dashboard - Account: verify the CURRENT email
 without changing it; signup mails the verification link - syncEmail message
 no longer says 'new' email

